OL,3,GNEWSARare chance to see historic
OL,4,ABridgwater tapestry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's answer to the Bayeux Tapestry
OL,7,Fgoes on display later as part of the
OL,8,Fnational festival Heritage Open Days
OL,9,F2026.
OL,11,FThe Bridgwater Historical Tapestry,
OL,12,Fwhich charts the story of the Somerset
OL,13,Ftown from the Stone Age through to
OL,14,Fmodern times, was stitched 75 years ago
OL,15,Fby local pupils.
OL,17,FIt is only the third time the tapestry
OL,18,Fhas been exhibited and it coincides
OL,19,Fwith the opening of the Bayeux Tapestry
OL,20,Fthis week at the British Museum in
OL,21,FLondon.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
