OL,3,GNEWSARare chance to see historic
OL,4,ABridgwater tapestry
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors can view the 32-metre long
OL,7,Fartefact at St Mary's Church from 10:00
OL,8,Fto 15:00 BST and entry is free.
